From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sean O'Hollaren <sean.ohollaren@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 21:14:44 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] FM-1: what a knob or button has just done is written large
 across the top of the picture

fm1_osd.h: capitals 5 dots by 7, each dot 2 x 2 panel pixels, in lines of 20 on a band dimmed to a
quarter, for three seconds; about twice the size the game's own message font has on the panel.
fm1_video.c draws it into each panel row as it goes out, so it is sharp (the game's picture is
squeezed 4 to 3 on its way to the panel) and also shows over the title and the menus. The game's own
messages are not changed.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
